TO: [Hon. MP's Name]
FROM: Major Dr. Kabanga Allan

RE: Request for Sponsorship – National Languages (Official Status) Bill 2025

Dear Hon. [MP's Name],

I respectfully seek your endorsement and potential parliamentary sponsorship of the National Languages (Official Status) Bill, 2025. This bill proposes the recognition of Bemba and Lozi as official national languages of Zambia alongside English, based on the 2020 Census.

Given your representation of [Province], your support will be pivotal. Please find enclosed the complete bill documentation.

Sincerely,
Major Dr. Kabanga Allan
